Thinker is an open-source LLM gateway for AI agents. It exposes
OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible endpoints, routes each request to the
right model and provider (with fallbacks and quotas), and records cost,
tokens and full request logs in a web dashboard.

This port runs the official build natively on FreeBSD with Node.js and
a dedicated PostgreSQL cluster managed by the thinker_db rc(8) script.
